# Auth

Athlete APIs use `requireCurrentHyroxAthleteForApi`. That helper already rejects a signed admin-preview cookie. Do not add a second preview bypass.

Coach APIs use `requireHyroxCoachApi` before the service-role client. Service role skips RLS, so a missing check exposes every athlete.

`INTERNAL_ADMIN_EMAILS` empty must not mean "everyone is a coach" in new code. Follow the existing fail-open only where it already exists. Do not widen it.

An athlete query is scoped by that athlete id. Never accept an id from the client without checking it matches the signed-in athlete, except coach routes that have already passed the coach check.

Run `npm run qa:hyrox-auth` after changing this area.
